{"root":{"data":{"id":"dksq6kqvt8o0","created":1787122861741,"text":"学会提问"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksq6v1ia740","created":1787122884151,"text":"1 寻找论题","expandState":"expand","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-4.999999850988388,"y":-7.9999997615813925}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksq9qkydb40","created":1787123109535,"text":"论题类型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksq9vt9br40","created":1787123120921,"text":"描述性论题","note":"描述是不是\n描述性论题是指关于各种对过去、现在或将来的\neg.音乐学习是不是有助于提高一个人的数学能力？"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksqcvqevjc0","created":1787123355842,"text":"规定性论题","note":"规定性论题是指关于什么该做、什么不该做、什么是对、什么是错、什么是好、什么是坏的问题。\ne.g. 公立学校里应不应该教授智能设计？"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dksqi2o7j6g0","created":1787123762767,"text":"方法论"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksqims62rk0","created":1787123806542,"text":"文章开头"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksqis4703s0","created":1787123818153,"text":"寻找结论"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksqjfb8ieo0","created":1787123868645,"text":"指示词","note":"因此\n表明\n由此可知\n……"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksqjuut1i80","created":1787123902480,"text":"结论不是什么","note":"例证\n数据\n定义\n背景材料\n证据"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksqkfbnb9k0","created":1787123947034,"text":"交流的语境和作者的背景"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dksqowinx1c0","created":1787124297920,"text":"2 寻找论据"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksqxsfwbeg0","created":1787124994323,"text":"引出论据","note":"每个论证时都采取怀疑的态度，你要问的第一个问题就是“为什么”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksr0o96jo80","created":1787125220302,"text":"方法论"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksr2z23ygg0","created":1787125400548,"text":"论据真实性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dksr0loof5k0","created":1787125214709,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}